  vendorName: Tycoon Hawthorne
  offerText: Purchase this heavy, sealed bank safe. It requires massive floor space
    and most of your capital, but the pure gold bullion inside will make you a king.
  acceptResultText: You drag the massive safe inside and break the lock. It is completely
    empty! You sink to the floor, devastated by the loss of your money.
  rejectResultText: ou refuse the gamble, though you wonder if you just walked away
    from a fortune.
  acceptedDelayedText: A quirky billionaire collector sees the vintage safe through
    your window. He pays an absolutely staggering amount of cash just for the empty
    antique metal box!
  rejectedDelayedText: 'ou read the newspaper: someone else bought Hawthorne''s safe
    and found a secret compartment filled with rare diamonds! The regret makes you
    physically sick.'
